 | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
 | Node.js        | major version 22 only                                                                                                                                         |                                                                                                                                                      | any major other than 22                                                                 |
